      CFLAGS_UBSAN rather than appending to it, so it replaced the
      -fsanitize=undefined that the previous check had set, and
      CFLAGS_BUGTRAP reached the compiler with AddressSanitizer alone.
      Fixes bug XXXXX; bugfix on 0.4.1.1-alpha.
    - Consult the -fsanitize=undefined link result when reporting that
      -fsanitize=undefined cannot be linked, rather than the
      -fsanitize=address one. Fixes bug XXXXX; bugfix on 0.2.9.1-alpha.
